  "title": "Dad's Breakfast Bread",
  "description": "This is my dad's version of scones. It is a dough like cinnamon roll dough and it is fried in hot oil. Very good Sunday treat. Served with honey, jam or sprinkled with powdered sugar",
  "authors": [
    "PIONEERGIRL"
